# SAFETY AND ACCESS [CRITICAL]

## Rule 1: GitLab and Confluence are READ-ONLY

No commits/pushes/merges/edits to GitLab or Confluence via AI unless the user explicitly runs a separate approved write workflow.

### Rule 1a: Confluence write tools FORBIDDEN

Forbidden MCP tools include: `updateConfluencePage`, `createConfluencePage`, create/edit/delete Confluence comments/pages.

Allowed: get/search/list Confluence read tools.

## Rule 7: Path modification

Follow Rule 0.8 in `core_rules.mdc` and `protectedPaths` in `.cursor/project-config.json`.

## Secrets

Never log or commit tokens, passwords, or API keys. Use `.env` locally only.
